# The README section 5 walkthrough as ready-to-send requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client).
# Start the API first (README section 3). Replace <PLACEHOLDER> with the DemoUsers__Password you set in
# your local .env. Never commit a real password here.

@api = http://localhost:8080
@password = <PLACEHOLDER>

### Log in as alice (linked to WH-A). Expect 200 with accessToken.
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"alice","password":"{{password}}"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Create a product. Expect 201 + Location: /products/SKU-1
POST {{api}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"SKU-1","description":"Demo product"}

### Create it again. Expect 409 duplicate_product_code
POST {{api}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"SKU-1","description":"Demo product"}

### List products. Expect 200
GET {{api}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one product. Expect 200
GET {{api}}/products/SKU-1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown product. Expect 404 product_not_found
GET {{api}}/products/NO-SUCH-SKU
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a warehouse (the creator is linked to it). Expect 201
POST {{api}}/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"WH-1","name":"Demo warehouse"}

### List warehouses. Expect 200: WH-A and WH-1 only
GET {{api}}/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Receive stock into a linked warehouse. Expect 200, quantity 10
POST {{api}}/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productCode":"SKU-1","warehouseCode":"WH-A","quantity":10}

### Stock by product. Expect 200: linked warehouses only
GET {{api}}/stock?productCode=SKU-1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock by warehouse. Expect 200
GET {{api}}/stock?warehouseCode=WH-A
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transfer 7 from WH-A to WH-B (destination may be any existing warehouse). Expect 201
POST {{api}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productCode":"SKU-1","sourceWarehouseCode":"WH-A","destinationWarehouseCode":"WH-B","quantity":7}

### The same transfer again. Expect 400 insufficient_stock: requested 7, available 3
POST {{api}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productCode":"SKU-1","sourceWarehouseCode":"WH-A","destinationWarehouseCode":"WH-B","quantity":7}

### WH-B is not linked to alice, so it looks unknown. Expect 404 warehouse_not_found
GET {{api}}/stock?warehouseCode=WH-B
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token. Expect 401 unauthorized
GET {{api}}/products

### Health. Expect 200
GET {{api}}/health

### OpenAPI document (Development only). Expect 200
GET {{api}}/openapi/v1.json
